"Bokabvs are shy herd creatures with an excellent sense of smell; a few small herds live on Thegund."
"They see each other by their bioluminescent drool."
"A bokabv turned demon is likeliest to be a herdmother."
"Bokabvs, called bisonvarks, live about eighteen Artonan years; calves mature in about a year and a half."
